WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.350
James Cameron announced
four "Avatar" sequels,

00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:06.770
and the last one doesn't
even come out until 2027.

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:08.290
That's so far away!

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:10.610
What if I don't live that long?

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:14.120
Look, I know I'm just a
prostitute your mom paid for,

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:16.613
but have ever tried Na'Vitamins?

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.830
They're specially formulated multivitamins

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:23.250
that contain over 38 key nutrients

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:25.620
designed to keep people
with an "Avatar" fan

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:27.620
body type just barely alive enough

00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:29.650
to enjoy all the "Avatar" sequels.

00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:32.080
And Na'Vitamins come in four strengths.

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:34.050
But will Na'Vitamins
keep me healthy enough

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:36.400
to do all my favorite activities?

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:38.125
Depends, like what?

00:00:38.125 --> 00:00:39.369
Sit?
Sure.

00:00:39.369 --> 00:00:40.450
Eat?
Uh- huh.

00:00:40.450 --> 00:00:42.221
Sit?
Yup.

00:00:42.221 --> 00:00:44.923
Cool, but what if I'm
already on my death bed?

00:00:44.923 --> 00:00:46.680
Well if you've already been diagnosed

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:48.780
with a critical condition, you can upgrade

00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:50.840
to the Unobtanium Life Drip.

00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:53.180
It induces a medical coma
preserving just enough

00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:56.354
brain activity to allow your
eyes to register movement.

00:00:56.354 --> 00:01:00.873
And when you're all done, you're all done.

00:01:02.940 --> 00:01:04.610
Wow, how do you know so much

00:01:04.610 --> 00:01:06.440
about about these Na'Vitamins?

00:01:06.440 --> 00:01:09.330
That's a prostitute's secret.

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:11.883
Na'Vitamins, finally a reason to live.

